1. Create a role using resource "aws_iam_role". Inside the resource you s
point assume_role_policy to data "aws_iam_policy_document", which is the trust
policy. This will tell the role that it is assuming whichever services that 
are fetch by the data block.
2. Create data "aws_iam_policy_document" fetching the service that will
be used by the role
3. create the permission policy with the block data "aws_iam_policy_document"
4. create resource "aws_iam_role_policy" that which attach permission policy
to the role